{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>Hear now.</b> Like [its meaning] here." "<b>Your prophet.</b> Whoever among you is a prophet of YHWH." "<b>In a vision.</b> Its meaning: if he were your prophet, that is, a prophet of YHWH — like [the examples] 'and the prophecy of Oded the prophet' [2 Chron. 15:8], 'Oholah...Sarah her mother,' [and] 'Your throne, O Elohim, is forever.'" "<b>In a vision.</b> In night visions." "<b>In a dream I speak with him.</b> Doubled, in the manner of prophetic [utterances]."], :book :numbers, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 12, :notes {2 "The verse citations are inferred from the quoted Hebrew phrases; Ibn Ezra's text gives only the quotations without explicit references. The middle quotation's source is uncertain."}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:17:24.317231417Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}